h": 11.9}, {"q": "2025-06-30", "avail": "2025-08-15", "h": 312, "sh": 7569596, "N": 8039, "br": 3.881, "dbr": -0.238, "dh": -5.17}, {"q": "2025-09-30", "avail": "2025-11-15", "h": 319, "sh": 7855671, "N": 8024, "br": 3.976, "dbr": 0.095, "dh": 2.24}, {"q": "2025-12-31", "avail": "2026-02-15", "h": 348, "sh": 9603401, "N": 8625, "br": 4.035, "dbr": 0.059, "dh": 9.09}, {"q": "2026-03-31", "avail": "2026-05-16", "h": 339, "sh": 7769533, "N": 8741, "br": 3.878, "dbr": -0.157, "dh": -2.59}, {"q": "2026-06-30", "avail": "2026-08-15", "h": 361, "sh": 13178768, "N": 8857, "br": 4.076, "dbr": 0.198, "dh": 6.49}], "statements": {"n": 6, "from": "2025-10-28", "last": [{"d": "2026-10-29", "n": -0.97, "z": -1.47, "rz": 0.1, "q": "This is our second consecutive quarter of record revenue and unit volume. While orders were off the preceding quarter pace, they remained healthy and backlogs continued to grow. This positions us very well going into the seasonally slower winter months with the ability to adjust production depending on order trends. Wh…", "a": "Commenting on the quarter, President and Chief Executive Officer Bill Boor said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828026068294/cvco-20260926xex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-07-30", "n": 3.23, "z": 0.03, "rz": 0.2, "q": "This quarter saw the continuation of strong order momentum we saw at the end of Q4 2026. In Q1, we saw record shipments and grew our backlog by over 50%. These results don't happen with just one or two plants doing well. They are a reflection of order growth and the excellent job all of our teams have done responding t…", "a": "Commenting on the quarter, President and Chief Executive Officer Bill Boor said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828026051115/cvco-20260627xex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-22", "n": 0.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "q": "Cavco made a lot of progress across many fronts in fiscal year 2026. In addition to continuing a progression of digital marketing, branding and product line transformations, all aimed at improving the customer and retailer experience, we sold a record number of homes. We also joined forces with American Homestar which …", "a": "Commenting on the results, Bill Boor, President and Chief Executive Officer, said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828026037575/cvco-2026328xex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-01-29", "n": 0.0, "z": null, "rz": null, "q": "Industry shipments slowed in the quarter with HUD shipments at a significantly lower pace in the reported October and November period. Our operating approach was to use the backlog and additional days down over the holidays to maintain a steady daily production pace in the factories. Looking forward, affordable housing…", "a": "Commenting on the quarter, President and Chief Executive Officer Bill Boor said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828026004168/cvco-20251227xex991.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-31", "n": 6.45, "z": null, "rz": null, "q": "We saw continued strong performance from all phases of our business - production, retail and our Financial Services segment. Our teams executed with excellence in a fluid market with continuing macroeconomic risks.", "a": "Commenting on the quarter, President and Chief Executive Officer Bill Boor said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828025047635/cvco-20250927xex991.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-28", "n": 6.08, "z": null, "rz": null, "q": "We are excited to welcome Lisa to our Board,", "a": "said Bill Boor, President and Chief Executive Officer of Cavco", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/278166/000162828025046831/cvco-20251027xex991.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-10-29", "z": -1.47, "mood": "down"}, "say_do": {"mood": "down", "acts": "sell", "clash": false, "agree": true}}, "score": {"value": 45, "verdict": {"it": "Leggermente ribassista", "en": "Mildly bearish"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{